From: eelgaev <3100771+eelgaev@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mm: provide compatible lifetime exports for POWER9 NVLink2

NVIDIA 550.54.15's IBM ATS path requires a VA-space/mm association. Enabling
that association adds mmput() and __mmdrop() imports to UVM. These symbols
are GPL-only in the target kernel, and UVM inherits proprietary taint from
NVIDIA's core module, so the module loader cannot resolve them.

Older kernels also exported these functions GPL-only, but allowed UVM's
Dual MIT/GPL module to use them before the modern proprietary-taint
inheritance restriction. Provide non-GPL exports for these two functions
only when the POWER9 NVLink2 restoration is enabled. Retain their current
implementations and GPL-only exports for other configurations. NVIDIA's
conftest must still verify the NPU API and MM export availability.

Signed-off-by: eelgaev <3100771+eelgaev@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 kernel/fork.c | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/kernel/fork.c b/kernel/fork.c
--- a/kernel/fork.c
+++ b/kernel/fork.c
@@ -965,7 +965,12 @@ void __mmdrop(struct mm_struct *mm)
 
 	free_mm(mm);
 }
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PPC_POWERNV_NVLINK2)
+/* Legacy IBM ATS UVM uses this MM lifetime API. */
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(__mmdrop);
+#else
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(__mmdrop);
+#endif
 
 static void mmdrop_async_fn(struct work_struct *work)
 {
@@ -1401,7 +1406,12 @@ void mmput(struct mm_struct *mm)
 	if (atomic_dec_and_test(&mm->mm_users))
 		__mmput(mm);
 }
+#if IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_PPC_POWERNV_NVLINK2)
+/* Legacy IBM ATS UVM uses this MM lifetime API. */
+EXPORT_SYMBOL(mmput);
+#else
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(mmput);
+#endif
 
 #if defined(CONFIG_MMU) || defined(CONFIG_FUTEX_PRIVATE_HASH)
 static void mmput_async_fn(struct work_struct *work)
